UGUAAUUGAAUUUUGAACACU&UGACCCACCUCCUGGAAUGACCUUAAAUGAGAAGAGUGUUCAAAAUUCAAUUACACAGUGGAUUGUAGACAUGGAAGGUGCACCAGGUACCUUAUAUGAAGGGGAAAAAUUUCAACUUCUAUUUAAAUUUAGUAGUCGAUAUCCUUUUGACUCUCCUCAGGUCAUGUUUACUGGUGAAAAUAUUCCUGUUCAUCCUCAUGUUUAUAGCAAUGGUCAUAUCUGUUUAUCCAUUC\
